#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:1
msgid "H2 QPE Validation"
msgstr "H2 QPE 验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial checks the small H2 path used as the first q2m3 smoke test. It compares vacuum and "
"MM-embedded H2 Hamiltonians and reports stabilization in kcal/mol after explicit conversion from "
"Hartree."
msgstr "本教程检查用于 q2m3 首次冒烟测试的小规模 H2 路径。它比较真空和 MM 嵌入 H2 哈密顿量，并在从 Hartree 显式转换后，以 kcal/mol 报告稳定能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:7
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:13
msgid "The script performs four steps:"
msgstr "脚本执行四个步骤："

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:15
msgid "Build vacuum and solvated PennyLane Hamiltonians from PySCF data."
msgstr "根据 PySCF 数据构建真空和溶剂化 PennyLane 哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:16
msgid "Run classical Hartree-Fock references for vacuum and MM-embedded systems."
msgstr "对真空和 MM 嵌入体系运行经典 Hartree-Fock 参考计算。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:17
msgid "Execute QPE for both Hamiltonians."
msgstr "对两个哈密顿量执行 QPE。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:18
msgid "Compare HF and QPE stabilization energies."
msgstr "比较 HF 和 QPE 稳定能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.md:20
msgid "What The Example Builds"
msgstr "示例构建的体系"

